Description: ZFS Administration GUI
 Zyggy is a very simple GUI for basic ZFS administration.
 It provides graphical access for most frequently used ZFS and
 ZPOOL commands, including:
  - Dataset, volume, and snapshot management
  - Pool operations (create, destroy, status, scrub)
  - Disk and health monitoring (SMART, I/O stats)
 .
 It wraps the ZFS command-line tools (zfs, zpool) behind an
 intuitive GTK3 interface.
